{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EQmpmPBkgRew8gfLdC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the draft. It's about 200 words.\n\n<final_document>\nSubject: The Night Garden – fee\n\nHi Nadia,\n\nThank you for offering me The Night Garden. I'd love to illustrate it, and I'm glad to keep working with you.\n\nBefore I sign, I'd like to talk about the fee. I've been at $9,000 per book since my first book with you four years ago. Since then, [TITLE] and [TITLE] have each sold more than 20,000 copies. [TITLE] was on the [STATE] reading list and went into its fourth printing this spring.\n\nThe going rate for this work is now well above $9,000. Last year another publisher paid me $12,500 for a 32-page book of the same scope. My agent puts the standard range for an illustrator with my record at $11,000 to $13,000.\n\nFor The Night Garden, I'm asking for $11,500. At that fee I can commit to:\n\n- Sketches within six weeks of signing\n- Final art by September 1\n- Two extra spot illustrations for your marketing, at no charge\n\nEach book takes me about four months, and I want to keep giving your list that level of care. I know you need an answer by the end of next week. I'm happy to talk by phone if that would help.\n\nBest,\n[Your name]\n</final_document>\n\n- **I didn't use \"every other publisher pays at least $12,000.\"** You've only seen one other publisher's fee, so the sentence would be false. Nadia is a managing editor and probably knows what other publishers pay, so she'd likely see through it. The strongest true version is \"the going rate for this work is now well above $9,000.\" Both your $12,500 fee and the bottom of your agent's range back that up, and the two numbers that follow it are specific and can be checked.\n- **I left out your $11,000 floor and the gap in your schedule.** If she counters, you can come down to $11,000. If you'd like to push harder, you could add \"I'm not able to take it on at $9,000.\" It's true, but once you've said it you have to turn the book down if she refuses.\n- **Before sending,** fill in the three titles and the state."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":10030,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1008},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb59b644-1a66-4ce3-8f0d-f6c1ef33ee2b","uuid":"55a95c5e-014c-431d-8cd4-8cc67ec2b27f","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:24:02.450Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7EQmg5bB3wxquNgJUVJ"}
